This is a custom / inofficial package to provide the "classic" Electricsheep client for Linux.
Note that this client and framework was marekd as "only archive" by Upstream, in 2026-04
There is now a newer service, promoted by Upstream: https://infinidream.ai/

However, as of 2026-10, the classic client works just fine, also with "Gold sheep".

For this package, I integrated the latest fixes by the community.
Github: https://github.com/Ichthyostega/electricsheep/tree/deb
PPA: https://launchpad.net/~ichthyo/+archive/ubuntu/zeug


NOTE:
 - the old gnome-screensaver framework is obsolete.
 - I have not tested ElectricSheep on Gnome
 - For XFCE, xfce4-screensaver requires the executable to be provided
   from one of the special trusted locations. We install a symlink into
   /usr/lib/xscreensaver/ -> /usr/bin/electricsheep
 - The upstream sources also ship two shell scripts, "electricsheep-saver"
   and "electricsheep-saver-gnome". These are not used in this current setup.

Ichthyo, 2026-10


